        "description": "The objective of this course is to provide introduction to chemoinformatics, an interdisciplinary area on the interface of chemistry, informatics and biology. The student will be provided with understanding of fundamentals of chemoinformatics and its applications. Through lectures, hands-on exercises and assignments, the student is expected to achieve a good grasp of the concepts and applications of chemoinformatics.",
